  "limits": [
    "Signed v3 fixture invokes actual compiled public CLI, actual registered handler, real own loopback HTTP and own child/default PID liveness; spawner, post-admission port snapshot and own-child launch verification are controlled. This is not an installed BFF/native W/S launch.",
    "Independent continuous stream uses exact actual transport/version/diagnostics functions with actual HTTP in an isolated VM; it is complementary transport evidence, not a full CLI.",
    "Tracked tuple/identity and file-sink cases declare their synthetic process/fetch ports. Effective-env execution controls lifecycle side effects and does not start a BFF.",
    "77 retained selected owner/dependency paths are not a claim of the complete transitive runtime.",
    "The original misplaced grammar-red label is a refuted hypothesis, not a claimed defect; the shared grammar is moved unchanged.",
    "V1 timeout flag units and unsupported mock setup receive no one-second/causal RED credit; corrected signed V2/V3 fixtures retain their separate provenance.",
    "No Linuxx64 installed, Windows execution, actual packaged update/rollback/SSD, browser journey or model/skill acceptance is inferred.",
    "Frozen model inputs/outcomes and both acceptance ledgers remain unchanged."
  ],
